body:
Use the same enum display values as AnimationPlayer's `playback_auto_capture_transition_type` for consistency:

```suggestion
	ADD_PROPERTYI(PropertyInfo(Variant::INT, "animation/ease", PROPERTY_HINT_ENUM, "In,Out,InOut,OutIn,Unset"), "set_animation_ease", "get_animation_ease", PHASE_NORMAL);
	ADD_PROPERTYI(PropertyInfo(Variant::INT, "animation/transition", PROPERTY_HINT_ENUM, "Linear,Sine,Quint,Quart,Quad,Exponential,Elastic,Cubic,Circ,Bounce,Back,Spring,Unset"), "set_animation_transition", "get_animation_transition", PHASE_NORMAL);
```

Also, `Unset` can be removed at the end if it's not used.

